LE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-PAP-014"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF20", "label": "Study family SF20: Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "score": 1.141, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF20 (0.76)", "FAM:SF17 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF20"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Real player absences move the association structure (V1) and the LOO simulation predicts the magnitude (V2).", "observed_result": ["[APPA-006] Gate G2 21/23 (91%) above null median; V1(a) 16/23 above own-null p95, binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) mean(D_real - median_null)=+0.142, CI [+0.103, +0.187].", "[APPA-007] Gate G3 Spearman +0.099. V2a Spearman +0.288, p=0.077, CI [-0.244, +0.667] FAIL; V2b partial +0.253, p=0.115, CI [-0.262, +0.615] FAIL. Diagnostics: H_code ruled out (rho=0.933); dropping 2 absorption cases rh [cut; read_family for the full text]", "[PAP-023] V1(a) 16/23 above p95 binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) +0.142 CI[+0.103,+0.187] CONFIRMED; V2a rho=+0.288 p=0.077 CI[-0.244,+0.667]; V2b rho=+0.253 p=0.115 NOT"]}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-014", "label": "Study family SF-PAP-014: On/off identity displacement D_A (shaper vs usage-matched role occupant)", "score": 1.099, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPS-088 auto_related_family (repeated_by_later_family) FAM:SF-PAP-014", "FAM:SF-APPS-088 auto_related_family (repeat_of_earlier_family) FAM:SF-PAP-014"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "On/off identity displacement D_A (shaper vs usage-matched role occupant)", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Real on/off absence of a shaper displaces the team fingerprint more than a usage-matched non-shaper, and LOO L(p) tracks observe